# The Boulder, Ready to Rumble: only creatures count. A Jibbirik Omnivore (3/2, power 3) and an uncrewed Veloheart Bike (a 4/2 Vehicle, not a
# creature while it isn't crewed) do not count, so with The Boulder (4/4) X = 1 and the chosen Forest becomes a 1/1 haste land creature
# (CR 701.66a, 301.7). The Bike is cast on the turn of the attack, so it is counted, if at all, as the ability resolves (CR 608.2h).

